{"hero":{"title":{"zh":"精密注塑模具与注塑件","en":"Precision injection molds and molded parts"},"subtitle":{"zh":"模具设计、试模到批量注塑在同一厂区完成，内销与出口订单并行。","en":"Mold design, trial runs and volume molding are completed on one site, serving domestic and export orders."},"cta":{"zh":"提交图纸获取报价","en":"Send drawings for a quote"}},"about":{"title":{"zh":"关于我们","en":"About us"},"body":{"zh":"宁海精密注塑模具P3T 从事塑料注塑模具设计制造与精密注塑件生产，工厂设模具车间和注塑车间，按图纸或样品开模，并承接批量注塑。2008 年建厂，从模具维修和小型模具起步；2013 年注塑车间投产；2017 年开始承接出口订单；2021 年新增恒温精密模具车间；2024 年建成三坐标与影像测量室。内销与出口订单并行，出口以欧洲和东南亚为主。","en":"Ninghai Precision Injection Mold P3T designs and builds plastic injection molds and produces precision molded parts. The plant runs a mold shop and a molding shop, builds tools from drawings or samples and takes on volume molding. Founded in 2008, starting from mold repair and small molds; the molding shop started production in 2013; export orders began in 2017; a temperature-controlled precision mold shop was added in 2021; a CMM and vision measurement room was completed in 2024. Domestic and export orders run in parallel, with exports mainly to Europe and Southeast Asia."}},"features":{"title":{"zh":"优势","en":"Advantages"},"intro":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"items":[{"id":"quality","title":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"delivery","title":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"support","title":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}}]},"services":{"title":{"zh":"合作方式","en":"How we work"},"intro":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"items":[{"id":"dfm","title":{"zh":"图纸或样品确认","en":"Drawing or sample review"},"body":{"zh":"按图纸或样品开模；只有样品时先做 3D 扫描和逆向建模，图纸确认后再开模。","en":"Tools are built from drawings or samples; for samples only, 3D scanning and reverse modeling come first, and tooling starts after the drawing is confirmed."}},{"id":"trial","title":{"zh":"开模与试模","en":"Tooling and trial runs"},"body":{"zh":"T1 试模后 3 天内寄出样品和全尺寸检测报告，每套模具含 3 次试模。","en":"Samples and full-dimension inspection reports are shipped within 3 days after T1 trial; each mold includes 3 trial runs."}},{"id":"production","title":{"zh":"批量注塑","en":"Volume molding"},"body":{"zh":"模具确认后 15–20 天交付批量注塑件。","en":"Volume molded parts are delivered 15–20 days after mold approval."}},{"id":"inspection","title":{"zh":"出货检验","en":"Outgoing inspection"},"body":{"zh":"外观与功能全检，出货抽检并附检测报告。","en":"Full inspection of appearance and function, sampling inspection before shipment with test reports attached."}}]},"products":{"title":{"zh":"产品","en":"Products"},"intro":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},"contact":{"title":{"zh":"询盘","en":"Inquiry"},"body":{"zh":"把图纸或样品需求发到邮箱，我们按图纸或样品开模，并承接批量注塑。","en":"Send drawings or sample requirements by email; we build tools from drawings or samples and take on volume molding."},"email":"rfq@p3t-sim.test","phone":"待补充","address":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},"faq":{"title":{"zh":"常见问题","en":"Frequently asked questions"},"intro":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"items":[{"id":"sample-only","title":{"zh":"没有图纸只有样品能开模吗？","en":"Can you build a mold from a sample without drawings?"},"body":{"zh":"可以，先做 3D 扫描和逆向建模，图纸确认后再开模。","en":"Yes. We first do 3D scanning and reverse modeling, and start tooling after the drawing is confirmed."}},{"id":"lead-time","title":{"zh":"开模周期多久？","en":"How long does tooling take?"},"body":{"zh":"单腔模具约 25–35 天，多腔热流道和双色模具约 40–55 天，从图纸确认开始计。","en":"About 25–35 days for a single-cavity mold and 40–55 days for multi-cavity hot runner and two-shot molds, counted from drawing confirmation."}},{"id":"trial-samples","title":{"zh":"试模样品怎么提供？","en":"How are trial samples delivered?"},"body":{"zh":"T1 试模后 3 天内寄出样品和全尺寸检测报告，每套模具含 3 次试模。","en":"Samples and full-dimension inspection reports are shipped within 3 days after T1 trial; each mold includes 3 trial runs."}},{"id":"mold-ownership","title":{"zh":"模具归谁所有？","en":"Who owns the mold?"},"body":{"zh":"模具费付清后模具归买方所有，可存放在本厂用于批量生产。","en":"Once the mold cost is paid in full, the mold belongs to the buyer and can be stored at our plant for volume production."}},{"id":"trade-terms","title":{"zh":"出口订单用什么贸易条款？","en":"Which trade terms are used for export orders?"},"body":{"zh":"常用 FOB 宁波和 EXW，也可按订单约定 CIF。","en":"Commonly FOB Ningbo and EXW; CIF can also be agreed per order."}}]},"commercialTerms":[{"id":"moq","kind":"moq","value":{"zh":"注塑件 5000 件起；模具单套起接","en":"Molded parts from 5,000 pcs; molds from one set"}},{"id":"lead-time","kind":"lead_time","value":{"zh":"模具 25–55 天；批量注塑件在模具确认后 15–20 天","en":"Molds 25–55 days; volume molded parts 15–20 days after mold approval"}},{"id":"capacity","kind":"capacity","value":{"zh":"模具年产约 180 套；注塑机 42 台（90–800 t），月注塑能力约 600 万件","en":"About 180 mold sets per year; 42 molding machines (90–800 t), about 6 million molded parts per month"}},{"id":"trade-terms","kind":"trade_terms","value":{"zh":"常用 FOB 宁波和 EXW，也可按订单约定 CIF","en":"Commonly FOB Ningbo and EXW; CIF can be agreed per order"}}],"industries":{"title":{"zh":"应用行业","en":"Industries served"},"intro":{"zh":"为家电、汽车、医疗、照明和电动工具行业配套注塑模具与精密注塑件。","en":"Injection molds and precision molded parts for appliance, automotive, medical, lighting and power tool applications."},"items":[{"id":"appliance","title":{"zh":"家电外壳与结构件","en":"Appliance housings and structural parts"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"automotive","title":{"zh":"汽车内饰件与连接器","en":"Automotive interior parts and connectors"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"medical","title":{"zh":"医疗器械耗材外壳","en":"Medical consumable housings"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"lighting","title":{"zh":"照明透镜与灯罩","en":"Lighting lenses and covers"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"power-tools","title":{"zh":"电动工具壳体","en":"Power tool housings"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}}]},"capabilities":{"title":{"zh":"加工能力与设备","en":"Capabilities and equipment"},"intro":{"zh":"模具车间、注塑车间与检测设备在同厂区运行。","en":"Mold shop, molding shop and inspection equipment run on the same site."},"items":[{"id":"cnc","title":{"zh":"高速 CNC 加工中心","en":"High-speed CNC machining centers"},"body":{"zh":"12 台","en":"待补充"}},{"id":"wire-edm","title":{"zh":"精密慢走丝线切割","en":"Precision wire EDM"},"body":{"zh":"6 台","en":"待补充"}},{"id":"mirror-edm","title":{"zh":"镜面电火花","en":"Mirror EDM"},"body":{"zh":"8 台","en":"待补充"}},{"id":"surface-grinder","title":{"zh":"精密平面磨床","en":"Precision surface grinders"},"body":{"zh":"4 台","en":"待补充"}},{"id":"molding-machines","title":{"zh":"注塑机","en":"Injection molding machines"},"body":{"zh":"42 台（90–800 t）","en":"待补充"}},{"id":"two-shot-machines","title":{"zh":"双色注塑机","en":"Two-shot molding machines"},"body":{"zh":"3 台","en":"待补充"}},{"id":"cmm","title":{"zh":"三坐标测量机","en":"Coordinate measuring machine"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"vision","title":{"zh":"二次元影像测量仪","en":"Vision measuring system"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"colorimeter","title":{"zh":"色差仪","en":"Colorimeter"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"tensile","title":{"zh":"拉力试验机","en":"Tensile testing machine"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}},{"id":"climate-chamber","title":{"zh":"恒温恒湿箱","en":"Temperature and humidity chamber"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"}}]},"certifications":{"title":{"zh":"认证状态","en":"Certification status"},"intro":{"zh":"模具与注塑件业务的体系认证状态。","en":"Management system certification status for the mold and molding business."},"items":[{"id":"iso9001","title":{"zh":"ISO 9001","en":"ISO 9001"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"status":"已有"},{"id":"iso14001","title":{"zh":"ISO 14001","en":"ISO 14001"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"status":"已有"},{"id":"iatf16949","title":{"zh":"IATF 16949","en":"IATF 16949"},"body":{"zh":"待补充","en":"To be provided"},"status":"认证中"}]}}
[{"id":"multi-cavity-hot-runner-mold","sku":"待补充","name":{"zh":"多腔热流道模具","en":"Multi-cavity hot runner mold"},"summary":{"zh":"1–32 腔多腔热流道模具，最大模具尺寸 900×1200 mm。","en":"Multi-cavity hot runner molds with 1–32 cavities, up to 900×1200 mm mold size."},"category":{"zh":"注塑模具","en":"Injection molds"},"status":"published","imageColor":"#e6e1cf","specs":[{"name":{"zh":"型腔数","en":"Number of cavities"},"value":{"zh":"1–32 腔","en":"1–32 cavities"}},{"name":{"zh":"模具尺寸","en":"Mold size"},"value":{"zh":"最大 900×1200 mm","en":"Up to 900×1200 mm"}},{"name":{"zh":"模具钢材","en":"Mold steel"},"value":"S136/H13/NAK80"},{"name":{"zh":"热流道","en":"Hot runner"},"value":{"zh":"开放式/针阀式","en":"Open / valve gate"}},{"name":{"zh":"成型周期","en":"Cycle time"},"value":"12–40 s"},{"name":{"zh":"模具寿命","en":"Mold life"},"value":{"zh":"50–100 万模次","en":"500,000–1,000,000 shots"}},{"name":{"zh":"型腔公差","en":"Cavity tolerance"},"value":"±0.01 mm"}]},{"id":"two-shot-mold","sku":"待补充","name":{"zh":"双色注塑模具","en":"Two-shot molding mold"},"summary":{"zh":"适配 120–650 t 双色注塑机的旋转式或机械手转移双色模具。","en":"Two-shot molds for rotary or robot transfer molding on 120–650 t two-shot machines."},"category":{"zh":"注塑模具","en":"Injection molds"},"status":"published","imageColor":"#e6e1cf","specs":[{"name":{"zh":"成型方式","en":"Molding method"},"value":{"zh":"旋转式/机械手转移","en":"Rotary / robot transfer"}},{"name":{"zh":"适配机型","en":"Compatible machines"},"value":{"zh":"双色注塑机 120–650 t","en":"Two-shot machines 120–650 t"}},{"name":{"zh":"材料组合","en":"Material combinations"},"value":"PC+TPU/PP+TPE/ABS+PC"},{"name":{"zh":"包胶厚度","en":"Overmold thickness"},"value":"≥0.8 mm"},{"name":{"zh":"配合公差","en":"Mating tolerance"},"value":"±0.02 mm"},{"name":{"zh":"模具寿命","en":"Mold life"},"value":{"zh":"30–50 万模次","en":"300,000–500,000 shots"}}]},{"id":"precision-structural-parts","sku":"待补充","name":{"zh":"精密结构注塑件","en":"Precision structural molded parts"},"summary":{"zh":"适用 PA66+GF/POM/PBT/PC，单件重量 0.5–350 g。","en":"In PA66+GF/POM/PBT/PC, part weight 0.5–350 g."},"category":{"zh":"精密注塑件","en":"Precision molded parts"},"status":"published","imageColor":"#e6e1cf","specs":[{"name":{"zh":"适用材料","en":"Materials"},"value":"PA66+GF/POM/PBT/PC"},{"name":{"zh":"单件重量","en":"Part weight"},"value":"0.5–350 g"},{"name":{"zh":"尺寸公差","en":"Dimensional tolerance"},"value":"±0.02 mm"},{"name":{"zh":"平面度","en":"Flatness"},"value":"≤0.05 mm"},{"name":{"zh":"表面处理","en":"Surface finish"},"value":{"zh":"咬花/喷砂/高光","en":"Texture / blasting / high gloss"}},{"name":{"zh":"成型机台","en":"Molding machines"},"value":"90–800 t"}]},{"id":"optical-transparent-parts","sku":"待补充","name":{"zh":"透明光学注塑件","en":"Transparent optical molded parts"},"summary":{"zh":"PMMA/PC/COC 透明件，PMMA 2 mm 厚透光率 ≥90%。","en":"Transparent parts in PMMA/PC/COC, ≥90% light transmission for 2 mm PMMA."},"category":{"zh":"精密注塑件","en":"Precision molded parts"},"status":"published","imageColor":"#e6e1cf","specs":[{"name":{"zh":"适用材料","en":"Materials"},"value":"PMMA/PC/COC"},{"name":{"zh":"透光率","en":"Light transmission"},"value":{"zh":"≥90%（PMMA 2 mm 厚）","en":"≥90% (PMMA, 2 mm thick)"}},{"name":{"zh":"壁厚","en":"Wall thickness"},"value":"0.8–6 mm"},{"name":{"zh":"表面粗糙度","en":"Surface roughness"},"value":"Ra ≤0.02 μm"},{"name":{"zh":"成型环境","en":"Molding environment"},"value":{"zh":"十万级洁净车间","en":"Class 100,000 clean room"}},{"name":{"zh":"尺寸公差","en":"Dimensional tolerance"},"value":"±0.03 mm"}]},{"id":"metal-insert-parts","sku":"待补充","name":{"zh":"金属嵌件注塑件","en":"Metal insert molded parts"},"summary":{"zh":"铜螺母、冲压端子、不锈钢轴嵌件，立式 55–250 t 机台成型。","en":"Brass nut, stamped terminal and stainless steel shaft inserts, molded on vertical 55–250 t machines."},"category":{"zh":"精密注塑件","en":"Precision molded parts"},"status":"published","imageColor":"#e6e1cf","specs":[{"name":{"zh":"嵌件类型","en":"Insert types"},"value":{"zh":"铜螺母/冲压端子/不锈钢轴","en":"Brass nuts / stamped terminals / stainless steel shafts"}},{"name":{"zh":"嵌件放置","en":"Insert placement"},"value":{"zh":"机械手/人工","en":"Robot / manual"}},{"na